// 03 Checkout & Account and 04 Admin. Every screen is native, editable layers (auto-layout frames, text, shapes,
// component instances) laid out from SPEC, the static analysis of the repo that generate.mjs writes at the bottom
// of this file: tokens, routes, the admin IA, supabase/seed.sql content and the UI microcopy.
// Sandbox-safe syntax only: no optional chaining, no nullish coalescing, no object spread.

